WEBVTT

01:21.050 --> 01:26.760
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.539 --> 01:29.470
[Episode 14]

01:30.480 --> 01:32.820
If you had even a shred of sense,

01:33.300 --> 01:33.960
you'd never

01:34.430 --> 01:37.150
bring up divorce again.

01:37.560 --> 01:39.710
I will never agree to it.

01:41.950 --> 01:43.070
Gu Dezhao!

01:58.110 --> 01:59.310
I just want to ask you.

02:00.290 --> 02:02.750
Back then,
when you insisted on marrying me,

02:04.150 --> 02:05.950
was it out of genuine love for me,

02:06.400 --> 02:07.120
or

02:08.400 --> 02:10.600
merely for the support of the Ji family?

02:12.190 --> 02:14.000
You're acting like this again.

02:14.910 --> 02:15.820
Ji Han.

02:16.430 --> 02:18.120
It's been so many years.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.870
Why are you still asking this?

02:30.910 --> 02:31.590
My Lady.

02:32.150 --> 02:33.030
What did

02:34.560 --> 02:35.870
the Master say?

03:02.080 --> 03:04.310
These gardenias smell so good.

03:05.750 --> 03:06.360
Madam,

03:06.430 --> 03:08.030
they haven't even bloomed yet.

03:08.030 --> 03:09.560
That's probably magnolia.

03:17.240 --> 03:20.740
[Misty Waters, Gentle Waves]

03:18.960 --> 03:19.840
Madam.

03:25.090 --> 03:25.870
Madam,

03:26.430 --> 03:27.910
why did you come out?

03:28.840 --> 03:30.500
I wanted to get some fresh air.

03:31.800 --> 03:33.660
I brought you black chicken soup,

03:33.680 --> 03:35.940
with codonopsis and goji berries added,

03:36.079 --> 03:38.030
just right for your condition.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.150
Okay.

03:40.150 --> 03:41.520
Miss Gu is so filial.

03:41.710 --> 03:43.000
No wonder last night,

03:43.000 --> 03:44.680
Madam kept calling out for Zhao.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.410
[Misty Waters, Gentle Waves]

04:15.360 --> 04:16.670
You are so pretty.

04:17.740 --> 04:19.300
You are pretty too.

04:21.160 --> 04:23.020
You're just flattering me again.

04:23.680 --> 04:25.120
I'm not flattering you.

04:25.800 --> 04:27.070
If you weren't pretty,

04:27.630 --> 04:29.760
how could I end up looking good myself?

04:31.270 --> 04:33.270
I can never win an argument with you.

04:36.870 --> 04:37.630
It's been a while

04:37.630 --> 04:38.900
since I last saw Rong.

04:39.310 --> 04:41.040
He is so playful.

04:42.070 --> 04:43.300
I am playful?

04:43.800 --> 04:45.400
I came yesterday afternoon,

04:45.409 --> 04:46.480
yesterday evening,

04:46.480 --> 04:47.840
and this morning as well.

04:47.840 --> 04:49.300
How is it that I am playful?

04:49.430 --> 04:51.300
You always falsely accuse me.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.240
When he came this morning,

04:53.240 --> 04:54.200
you were still asleep,

04:54.200 --> 04:55.390
so we didn't wake you.

04:55.390 --> 04:55.950
Listen.

04:56.159 --> 04:57.520
Good thing I have a witness.

04:57.520 --> 04:58.720
All right, all right.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.870
My bad.

05:01.430 --> 05:03.600
It's getting windy. Let's go back inside.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.120
Okay.

05:05.260 --> 05:06.590
Mother, let me help you.

05:11.560 --> 05:12.220
Be careful.

05:15.600 --> 05:18.000
It is said that
there was once a tofu beauty,

05:18.680 --> 05:20.310
who was beautiful but never smiled.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.720
Two idle men

05:21.720 --> 05:22.240
made a bet.

05:22.240 --> 05:22.950
The first said,

05:22.950 --> 05:24.120
"If you can make her laugh

05:24.120 --> 05:25.260
with just one word,

05:25.310 --> 05:26.830
I'll give you five taels of silver."

05:26.830 --> 05:27.890
The second agreed,

05:28.040 --> 05:28.830
and they went

05:28.830 --> 05:30.160
to find the tofu beauty.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.270
They saw the woman standing at the door,

05:32.270 --> 05:33.360
with a dog nearby.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.040
The second man quickly stepped forward,

05:35.040 --> 05:36.040
fell to his knees

05:36.310 --> 05:37.370
in front of the dog,

05:37.480 --> 05:38.880
and called out "Father."

05:40.860 --> 05:41.850
The woman burst out laughing,

05:41.850 --> 05:43.090
just like you.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.530
Then the first man said,

05:44.530 --> 05:45.800
"If you can make her curse

05:45.800 --> 05:46.900
with one word,

05:47.040 --> 05:48.950
I'll give you another five taels."

05:48.950 --> 05:50.510
So the second man immediately looked up

05:50.510 --> 05:51.750
and shouted at her,

05:51.800 --> 05:52.480
"Mother!"

05:55.170 --> 05:55.870
How is it?

05:56.120 --> 05:57.920
I heard it from someone outside.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.430
It's been a tiring day.

06:00.390 --> 06:02.000
Go back and rest.

06:03.940 --> 06:05.490
You should rest early too.

06:05.630 --> 06:07.630
I'll come pay my respects tomorrow.

06:07.950 --> 06:08.750
I'll come too.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.680
Zhao.

06:29.390 --> 06:31.360
You have been back for a few days.

06:33.040 --> 06:33.830
Could you

06:35.680 --> 06:37.310
call me "Mother"?

07:03.000 --> 07:03.800
It's fine.

07:05.480 --> 07:06.360
It's fine.

07:07.040 --> 07:08.120
Go get some rest.

07:15.000 --> 07:15.870
Go.

07:42.680 --> 07:43.480
She just

07:43.480 --> 07:45.120
wants you to call her "Mother."

07:45.120 --> 07:46.250
Why won't you say it?

07:49.470 --> 07:51.870
You wouldn't understand
even if I told you.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.620
Let me ask you instead.

07:53.950 --> 07:54.920
Have you run into something

07:54.920 --> 07:56.310
these past few days?

07:57.920 --> 07:58.520
What?

07:58.680 --> 07:59.800
I'm in the manor every day

07:59.800 --> 08:00.560
and never go out.

08:00.560 --> 08:02.220
What trouble could I run into?

08:02.870 --> 08:03.720
It's getting late.

08:03.720 --> 08:04.650
Go back and rest.

08:15.190 --> 08:16.040
Ms. Zhao.

08:18.160 --> 08:20.620
Thank you for your hard work
all these years.

08:21.390 --> 08:23.120
What are you talking about, Madam?

08:23.120 --> 08:24.480
As long as I can take care of you,

08:24.480 --> 08:25.630
I don't find it hard.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.390
Madam, don't take

08:38.390 --> 08:39.990
the Master's words to heart.

08:40.480 --> 08:41.480
You have Rong

08:41.870 --> 08:42.840
and Zhao here,

08:43.270 --> 08:44.870
and Old Madam to support you.

08:45.360 --> 08:47.560
As long as you can take things in stride,

08:47.600 --> 08:49.240
you can live a good life.

08:58.910 --> 08:59.390
Come.

10:29.840 --> 10:31.360
My mother has come to take me home!

10:30.950 --> 10:33.120
[Rising Clouds and Radiant Skies]

10:31.910 --> 10:33.770
My mother has come to take me home!

10:35.080 --> 10:35.750
Mother!

10:38.150 --> 10:38.750
Mother?

10:49.550 --> 10:50.470
Mother.

11:02.240 --> 11:02.840
My Lady.

11:15.360 --> 11:16.550
What's wrong?

11:35.120 --> 11:35.790
My Lady.

11:39.270 --> 11:40.200
Madam... she...

12:32.080 --> 12:32.960
Zhao.

12:51.460 --> 12:52.190
Madam.

12:55.140 --> 12:56.540
What did you just call me?

13:11.360 --> 13:13.320
Did you get hurt anywhere?

13:18.250 --> 13:20.190
I am so sorry.

13:22.270 --> 13:23.320
In my whole life,

13:23.900 --> 13:26.050
the person I've felt most sorry for

13:27.080 --> 13:28.840
is my daughter—

13:29.430 --> 13:30.620
you.

13:53.730 --> 13:55.980
You've been back for a few days now.

13:57.630 --> 13:58.550
Could you

14:00.130 --> 14:01.870
call me "Mother"?

14:09.360 --> 14:10.150
It's fine.

14:11.660 --> 14:12.550
It's fine.

14:25.410 --> 14:26.550
Miss Gu.

14:27.840 --> 14:28.720
Madam...

14:37.760 --> 14:38.910
After Rong and I

14:38.910 --> 14:39.840
left last night,

14:41.770 --> 14:43.540
did anything happen?

14:44.240 --> 14:46.640
Madam was crying all night.

14:47.610 --> 14:49.650
You don't know, Miss Gu.

14:50.550 --> 14:51.320
Over the years,

14:51.320 --> 14:53.870
Master has grown distant from Madam.

14:54.750 --> 14:56.440
She has suffered in silence,

14:56.440 --> 14:58.130
unable to speak her pain,

14:59.020 --> 15:01.350
and it has worn her down
until she fell ill.

15:02.270 --> 15:04.030
Now, with Yuping suddenly appearing,

15:04.030 --> 15:06.030
Master refuses to
listen to any explanation

15:06.030 --> 15:06.790
and is convinced

15:06.790 --> 15:08.960
that Madam harmed Mrs. Yun.

15:09.670 --> 15:12.290
Madam has nowhere to defend herself.

15:12.630 --> 15:15.150
She even considered divorcing Master.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.050
Divorce?

15:20.030 --> 15:21.000
I think

15:21.340 --> 15:23.960
instead of
enduring things here in the Gu family,

15:23.960 --> 15:26.200
you might as well separate from Master

15:26.270 --> 15:27.600
and go back to Tongzhou.

15:27.870 --> 15:29.930
We could just live our own lives well.

15:30.490 --> 15:31.620
You mean...

15:33.310 --> 15:35.760
you want me to divorce your father?

15:38.320 --> 15:39.110
No, no.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.360
Absolutely not.

15:43.250 --> 15:45.850
The divorce papers
have already been written,

15:46.030 --> 15:47.680
but Master refuses to agree.

15:47.870 --> 15:48.600
He even came yesterday

15:48.600 --> 15:50.360
and had a fight with Madam.

15:50.750 --> 15:51.630
Miss Gu.

15:51.970 --> 15:54.150
Master must have said something

15:54.480 --> 15:57.300
that made Madam feel
she couldn't live anymore.

15:57.390 --> 15:59.070
Miss Gu.

15:59.640 --> 16:01.950
Madam is truly wronged.

16:05.670 --> 16:06.960
His courtyard

16:05.790 --> 16:09.670
[Hall of Virtue and Splendor]

16:06.960 --> 16:08.480
is near Baoxiang Temple.

16:08.710 --> 16:09.350
Moreover,

16:09.790 --> 16:11.670
it's elegant and quiet,

16:12.000 --> 16:14.090
with beautiful scenery all around.

16:14.480 --> 16:16.610
It's perfect for you to recover there.

16:17.960 --> 16:18.720
Great.

16:20.270 --> 16:20.840
Then,

16:21.070 --> 16:22.760
let's set out in two days.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.440
You are so pretty.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.000
Mother!

16:53.960 --> 16:55.080
Mother!

16:56.480 --> 16:57.240
Mother!

16:57.270 --> 16:58.270
Mother!

17:01.080 --> 17:01.840
Han.

17:04.160 --> 17:05.420
How could this happen?

17:05.880 --> 17:06.550
Mother.

17:06.640 --> 17:08.740
How could this happen?

17:10.069 --> 17:11.480
Gu Dezhao!

17:12.720 --> 17:13.900
I'll kill you!

17:14.160 --> 17:14.869
My Lady!

17:15.270 --> 17:16.440
I'll kill you!

17:16.440 --> 17:17.319
Miss Gu!

17:17.589 --> 17:18.510
Zhao!

17:18.510 --> 17:20.440
You killed my mother!

17:21.550 --> 17:23.140
Let me go!

17:23.310 --> 17:24.180
My Lady.

17:24.910 --> 17:26.660
I'll kill you!

17:26.930 --> 17:28.690
I'll kill you!

17:29.350 --> 17:30.830
Let me go!

17:31.550 --> 17:33.240
Let me go!

17:34.350 --> 17:35.400
Let me go.

17:39.970 --> 17:43.040
[Gu Mansion] [Memorial]

17:43.140 --> 17:46.360
[Enduring Family Legacy] [Memorial]

17:46.380 --> 17:47.330
[The Ji family, blessed by Heaven's
Mandate, prospers through generations]

17:47.350 --> 17:48.610
[The coffin of the Eldest Daughter,
Madam Han, of gentle and proper conduct]

17:51.090 --> 17:53.550
[Memorial]

17:56.640 --> 17:57.480
Mother.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.200
Mother.

18:04.030 --> 18:05.200
Mother.

18:15.510 --> 18:17.200
Old Madam Ji,

18:17.200 --> 18:18.680
and Mr. Ji have arrived.

18:49.880 --> 18:50.960
Han.

18:52.200 --> 18:53.350
I am here.

19:07.270 --> 19:09.070
I will take you home.

19:19.160 --> 19:20.880
Why didn't you ever tell me

19:23.650 --> 19:26.080
what was weighing on your heart?

19:27.680 --> 19:29.480
You were so willful,

19:30.310 --> 19:32.550
leaving me, as a parent,

19:35.400 --> 19:36.900
to see my child

19:37.780 --> 19:40.190
die before me.

19:45.640 --> 19:46.350
Mother.

19:55.020 --> 19:56.780
Where is Gu Dezhao?

19:58.310 --> 19:59.920
Where is he?

20:17.070 --> 20:18.440
Mother.

20:27.370 --> 20:29.660
How did my Han die?

20:37.440 --> 20:38.350
Tell me.

20:40.200 --> 20:43.300
How did my Han die?

20:46.750 --> 20:48.680
You heartless bastard.

20:49.930 --> 20:51.680
Get up!

20:51.750 --> 20:54.120
Give my Han back!

20:54.150 --> 20:56.510
Give me back her life!

20:56.510 --> 20:57.310
Grandmother.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.150
Song Miaohua,

21:09.110 --> 21:10.640
come out!

21:11.180 --> 21:12.250
Old Madam!

21:12.600 --> 21:13.790
With Mother's passing,

21:13.790 --> 21:15.840
our whole family is devastated.

21:16.030 --> 21:17.280
But this matter

21:17.300 --> 21:19.200
really has nothing to do
with my birth mother.

21:19.200 --> 21:21.150
It has nothing to do with her?

21:22.480 --> 21:23.830
It's true.

21:24.900 --> 21:27.770
Like mother, like daughter.

21:29.220 --> 21:31.240
-Get up!
-Mother!

21:33.270 --> 21:35.070
Yun Xiang?

21:36.070 --> 21:37.730
Yuping?

21:38.200 --> 21:39.530
You and your daughter

21:39.750 --> 21:41.500
schemed to

21:42.070 --> 21:43.920
framed Han

21:43.940 --> 21:46.240
with baseless accusations

21:47.270 --> 21:49.360
and drove her

21:49.390 --> 21:51.110
to her death!

21:51.130 --> 21:51.650
Mother!

21:53.240 --> 21:54.230
Neither my birth mother nor I

21:54.230 --> 21:55.030
ever meant to

21:55.050 --> 21:56.510
drive Mother to her death.

21:57.200 --> 21:58.560
None of us expected that

21:58.660 --> 21:59.970
she would take her own life.

21:59.970 --> 22:00.660
Shut up!

22:01.720 --> 22:03.470
You still dare argue back?

22:05.550 --> 22:08.760
Do you think I can't punish you?

22:09.720 --> 22:10.640
Guards!

22:10.660 --> 22:12.080
Wait, Old Madam!

22:13.330 --> 22:15.140
Lan is just young and ignorant.

22:15.160 --> 22:17.310
She just spoke nonsense
in a moment of panic.

22:17.310 --> 22:19.040
Please forgive her, Old Madam.

22:19.720 --> 22:20.450
Yuping

22:20.960 --> 22:22.370
was brought in by me.

22:22.550 --> 22:24.150
It has nothing to do with Lan.

22:24.400 --> 22:25.510
Today's disaster

22:26.240 --> 22:28.170
is entirely my fault.

22:29.640 --> 22:31.480
I know my sins are unforgivable.

22:32.920 --> 22:35.850
Whatever punishment you choose—
beating, killing,

22:36.680 --> 22:38.610
or selling me off—I will accept it.

22:47.560 --> 22:48.540
It's not like that.

22:48.540 --> 22:49.400
-Mother.
-Lan!

22:54.270 --> 22:55.920
I beg you to see the truth, Old Madam.

22:55.920 --> 22:57.650
This is about past grievances.

22:57.790 --> 22:59.030
Lan is just a child.

22:59.030 --> 23:00.690
What could she possibly know?

23:02.000 --> 23:03.660
Whatever mistakes were made,

23:03.750 --> 23:05.160
they are all my fault.

23:06.270 --> 23:08.100
I beg you to punish me, Old Madam.

23:09.550 --> 23:11.010
I will have no complaints.

23:11.830 --> 23:12.750
Alright.

23:14.080 --> 23:16.480
You asked for this.

23:17.790 --> 23:18.880
Luo Yongping.

23:20.000 --> 23:21.310
Yes, Old Madam.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.390
Concubine Song

23:24.110 --> 23:26.350
has served Madam Ji respectfully.

23:28.200 --> 23:30.390
Unable to bear Madam Ji's passing,

23:31.110 --> 23:32.200
she has requested

23:32.680 --> 23:34.440
to keep vigil for Madam Ji.

23:35.070 --> 23:36.510
From tomorrow,

23:37.190 --> 23:40.120
she will be sent to
the Ji family's ancestral temple.

23:41.240 --> 23:42.300
and shall not leave

23:43.510 --> 23:45.000
until death.

23:55.830 --> 23:56.830
I, Song Miaohua,

23:58.400 --> 23:59.820
thank you, Old Madam.

24:14.720 --> 24:15.440
Mother!

24:15.880 --> 24:16.480
Mother.

24:18.240 --> 24:18.960
Lan.

24:19.390 --> 24:20.740
I'm sorry.

24:21.440 --> 24:23.030
I won't be by your side anymore.

24:23.030 --> 24:24.560
Take good care of yourself.

24:24.860 --> 24:26.120
Don't throw tantrums.

24:26.400 --> 24:27.030
Mother!

24:28.000 --> 24:28.720
Mother!

24:31.640 --> 24:32.680
It shouldn't be like this.

24:32.680 --> 24:34.200
It shouldn't be like this.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.270
Father! Father!

24:36.550 --> 24:38.880
Father, please save my mother.

24:38.960 --> 24:39.750
Father!

24:40.130 --> 24:41.510
-I can't save her.
-Father.

24:41.510 --> 24:42.520
I beg you.

24:42.540 --> 24:44.290
It's all karma.

24:45.000 --> 24:46.400
What are you waiting for?

24:46.400 --> 24:48.400
Drag this wretch away!

24:48.400 --> 24:48.960
Yes.

24:50.750 --> 24:51.480
Lan!

24:51.550 --> 24:52.110
Lan!

24:52.200 --> 24:53.310
Mother! Mother!

24:53.310 --> 24:53.920
Lan.

24:55.350 --> 24:56.990
Never be like me

24:57.310 --> 24:58.640
and become a concubine.

24:59.310 --> 25:00.840
-Remember what I said.
-Go.

25:01.030 --> 25:01.830
Remember.

25:01.920 --> 25:03.400
Better to be a poor man's wife

25:03.400 --> 25:03.960
-Hurry up.
-Mother!

25:03.960 --> 25:06.200
than a rich man's concubine.

25:06.270 --> 25:07.310
Mother!

25:44.140 --> 25:45.310
Mother!

25:53.680 --> 25:54.720
Zhao.

25:56.640 --> 25:58.000
My poor...

25:59.310 --> 26:00.380
-Grandmother!
-Grandmother!

26:00.380 --> 26:00.900
Grandmother!

26:00.900 --> 26:01.550
-Old Madam.
-Grandmother.

26:01.550 --> 26:02.680
-Grandmother.
-Go.

26:02.960 --> 26:04.510
Quick, get a physician.

26:08.790 --> 26:09.920
With this modification,

26:09.920 --> 26:11.530
it becomes easier to conceal

26:11.680 --> 26:12.880
and harder to detect.

26:13.110 --> 26:14.310
But the drawback is that

26:14.310 --> 26:15.790
it can only hold a few needles

26:15.790 --> 26:16.990
and has a short range.

26:17.110 --> 26:17.720
This single advantage

26:17.720 --> 26:19.160
of being hard to detect

26:19.400 --> 26:21.000
outweighs everything else.

26:22.510 --> 26:24.370
What are you tinkering with here?

26:25.960 --> 26:26.550
My Lady.

26:26.920 --> 26:27.650
Master Xiao.

26:44.240 --> 26:44.750
Hey.

26:47.460 --> 26:48.560
Ignoring me?

26:49.790 --> 26:51.790
Are you holding a grudge against me?

26:52.800 --> 26:53.470
Fine.

26:54.480 --> 26:56.350
I was going to ask

26:56.410 --> 26:57.720
if you wanted to go

26:57.750 --> 26:59.010
to Madam Ji's funeral.

26:59.590 --> 27:00.790
Since you don't care,

27:00.920 --> 27:01.510
never mind then.

27:01.510 --> 27:02.110
Come back.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.160
Madam Ji?

27:05.000 --> 27:06.330
You mean Zhao's mother?

27:08.280 --> 27:09.640
She died yesterday morning.

27:09.640 --> 27:10.070
She...

27:10.680 --> 27:12.160
Although she was seriously ill,

27:12.160 --> 27:13.110
it wasn't fatal.

27:13.440 --> 27:15.400
How could she have suddenly passed away?

27:15.400 --> 27:16.350
I really don't know

27:16.350 --> 27:17.510
the exact reason.

27:18.240 --> 27:19.590
There were no signs at all.

27:19.590 --> 27:21.390
She was just gone all of a sudden.

27:22.010 --> 27:23.160
Your brother-in-law and Xian

27:23.160 --> 27:24.960
have already been to that manor.

27:25.590 --> 27:27.310
Since I have Hui with me,

27:27.440 --> 27:28.640
Old Madam said

27:28.750 --> 27:30.280
my attendance is optional.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.480
If you want to go,

27:31.610 --> 27:32.480
I'll talk to Father

27:32.480 --> 27:33.670
and lift your restriction,

27:33.670 --> 27:35.330
and take you with me tomorrow.

27:36.310 --> 27:38.510
Why are you being so nice all of a sudden?

27:39.240 --> 27:40.920
I pity you.

27:41.960 --> 27:43.880
Anyway, Zhao's mother has passed away,

27:43.880 --> 27:45.480
Zhao must observe three years of mourning

27:45.480 --> 27:46.680
and cannot marry.

27:47.960 --> 27:50.160
Then I have nothing left to worry about.

28:28.480 --> 28:29.110
My Lady.

28:38.590 --> 28:39.350
It's dawn.

28:40.270 --> 28:42.200
Why don't you rest a little longer?

28:42.200 --> 28:43.020
Anyway,

28:43.110 --> 28:45.440
no one will be coming
to offer condolences now.

28:45.440 --> 28:46.440
I'm fine.

28:53.440 --> 28:54.840
Where are the two of them?

28:56.310 --> 28:58.440
They probably went somewhere to rest.

29:01.240 --> 29:02.590
You stay here.

29:04.320 --> 29:06.190
I'm going to see Grandmother.

29:44.550 --> 29:45.960
The physician added some calming medicine

29:45.960 --> 29:47.440
to the prescription.

29:47.920 --> 29:48.680
Last night,

29:48.920 --> 29:50.750
she finally slept soundly.

29:51.920 --> 29:54.550
Otherwise, she would have woken up
several times every night.

29:54.550 --> 29:56.400
She is getting old after all.

29:56.750 --> 29:59.000
It is truly worrisome.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.510
Grandmother said yesterday,

30:05.710 --> 30:09.840
[The Fragrant Brocade Pavilion]

30:07.070 --> 30:08.270
in accordance with Aunt's final wishes,

30:08.270 --> 30:10.640
she will be taken back
to Tongzhou for burial.

30:10.640 --> 30:12.370
She plans to go back the morning

30:12.480 --> 30:14.410
the day after tomorrow to prepare.

30:14.870 --> 30:16.800
I'm worried her body won't hold up.

30:17.880 --> 30:18.960
Please try your best

30:18.960 --> 30:20.220
to persuade her for me.

30:21.790 --> 30:22.830
You know

30:22.830 --> 30:24.160
Grandmother's temper.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.400
She can't be persuaded at all.

30:25.400 --> 30:26.160
Besides,

30:26.720 --> 30:28.250
it's good for her to go back.

30:28.640 --> 30:29.530
Staying here

30:30.070 --> 30:32.000
will only make her even more upset.

30:34.590 --> 30:35.160
Okay.

30:36.930 --> 30:38.200
Then take good care of her

30:38.200 --> 30:39.070
on the way.

30:39.550 --> 30:40.440
Rest assured.

30:40.750 --> 30:41.480
I've arranged everything

30:41.480 --> 30:42.640
for Grandmother.

30:42.960 --> 30:43.590
Moreover,

30:44.440 --> 30:45.350
Grandmother told me

30:45.350 --> 30:46.880
to stay and take care of you.

30:47.030 --> 30:48.000
I'm fine.

30:48.160 --> 30:49.960
I also want to stay here with you.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.330
-I really…
-Be good.

31:00.330 --> 31:05.500
[The Fragrant Brocade Pavilion]

31:05.600 --> 31:08.230
[Chen Mansion]

31:07.070 --> 31:07.870
Third Master.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.310
The Gu household is in
complete chaos right now.

31:08.310 --> 31:10.710
[Reflect constantly, stay disciplined;
cultivate virtue and the heart]

31:09.750 --> 31:11.130
I had someone ask around.

31:11.130 --> 31:12.680
There are all kinds of rumors.

31:12.680 --> 31:13.960
Some say she died of illness.

31:13.960 --> 31:15.000
Some say she was angered to death

31:15.000 --> 31:16.060
by that concubine.

31:16.640 --> 31:17.570
And some even say

31:17.830 --> 31:19.030
she took her own life.

31:20.550 --> 31:22.240
Have someone investigate carefully

31:22.240 --> 31:23.480
what really happened.

31:23.480 --> 31:24.350
It's best to ask

31:24.350 --> 31:25.830
people close to her directly.

31:25.830 --> 31:26.240
Yes.

31:41.400 --> 31:42.160
The expenses

31:42.550 --> 31:44.920
for the carriage and the tea
were recorded incorrectly.

31:44.920 --> 31:46.050
Recalculate them

31:46.310 --> 31:47.840
and come back for the money.

31:48.070 --> 31:48.680
Yes.

31:51.330 --> 31:52.000
Next.

31:57.750 --> 31:58.350
Stop.

31:59.410 --> 32:00.870
You haven't answered yet.

32:01.070 --> 32:02.200
Why are you leaving?

32:04.570 --> 32:05.370
My Lady.

32:05.510 --> 32:06.920
I've come to withdraw

32:06.920 --> 32:09.070
the donation money for the temple.

32:09.440 --> 32:11.070
I'm worried the accounts aren't correct,

32:11.070 --> 32:12.670
so I plan to recalculate them

32:12.680 --> 32:13.830
before coming back to you.

32:13.830 --> 32:15.360
Bring me your account book.

32:36.160 --> 32:37.880
You're not miscalculating.

32:39.270 --> 32:41.400
You've calculated it far too clearly,

32:43.350 --> 32:44.350
even counting

32:44.350 --> 32:45.810
your own ritual expenses.

32:46.550 --> 32:48.490
I'm not good at calculations.

32:48.550 --> 32:50.080
Please forgive me, My Lady.

32:50.350 --> 32:51.810
Not good at calculations?

32:52.510 --> 32:53.650
You are too modest.

32:54.750 --> 32:56.010
Look at your accounts.

32:56.510 --> 32:57.640
They are so precise.

32:57.720 --> 32:59.450
You are obviously not a novice.

33:00.910 --> 33:02.960
You've been with the Gu family for years.

33:02.960 --> 33:03.550
I should

33:04.110 --> 33:05.710
be showing you some respect.

33:06.070 --> 33:08.130
But this isn't just any other matter.

33:09.200 --> 33:10.480
Madam has passed away,

33:11.200 --> 33:13.060
and the whole family is grieving.

33:13.200 --> 33:13.960
Yet you're thinking about

33:13.960 --> 33:15.820
siphoning money from the estate.

33:16.920 --> 33:17.480
Guards.

33:17.720 --> 33:18.450
Drag him out,

33:18.750 --> 33:19.870
give him twenty strokes,

33:19.870 --> 33:20.590
and kick him out!

33:20.590 --> 33:20.920
Yes.

33:20.920 --> 33:22.720
Spare my life, My Lady!

33:22.880 --> 33:24.490
Forgive me, My Lady!

33:24.640 --> 33:25.400
My Lady!

33:26.160 --> 33:26.880
My Lady!

33:28.510 --> 33:29.070
Miss Gu.

33:31.000 --> 33:31.720
Guard Chen.

33:32.230 --> 33:32.880
Third Master ordered me

33:32.880 --> 33:33.830
to send some servants

33:33.830 --> 33:34.680
for you to use.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.510
They are all waiting outside.

33:36.510 --> 33:37.480
Third Master also said

33:37.480 --> 33:39.210
he will come see you a bit later.

33:40.240 --> 33:40.840
Thank you.

33:56.720 --> 33:57.480
I know.

33:59.160 --> 33:59.750
You think

33:59.750 --> 34:01.640
this is my first time
managing the household.

34:01.640 --> 34:02.640
And I'm just a girl

34:02.920 --> 34:03.790
with a thin skin

34:04.200 --> 34:05.200
and easy to bully.

34:06.900 --> 34:08.909
If that's what you think, you're wrong.

34:08.909 --> 34:10.710
Anyone who isn't afraid of death

34:11.030 --> 34:12.090
can come and try me.

34:12.889 --> 34:14.710
And those who don't want to work here

34:14.710 --> 34:16.060
can tell me now.

34:17.730 --> 34:19.060
Forgive us, Miss Gu.

34:19.090 --> 34:20.480
Forgive us, Miss Gu.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.920
Forgive us, Miss Gu.

34:21.940 --> 34:23.570
Forgive us, Miss Gu.

34:27.550 --> 34:28.030
Thanks.

34:28.030 --> 34:28.940
Let's go.

34:29.280 --> 34:29.880
Third Master.

34:29.880 --> 34:30.610
You're here.

34:31.469 --> 34:32.530
I'll take my leave.

34:33.000 --> 34:33.600
How is she?

34:35.000 --> 34:36.400
She seems fine.

34:36.710 --> 34:37.670
Everything is being handled

34:37.670 --> 34:38.670
in an orderly way.

34:39.190 --> 34:40.630
The more orderly she seems,

34:40.630 --> 34:42.290
the worse she actually feels.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.290
Lord Chen, please wait.

34:49.380 --> 34:50.230
The Grand Secretary

34:50.230 --> 34:52.760
requests your presence
at Wenyuan Pavilion.

34:56.980 --> 34:58.630
Go fetch me a set of mourning clothes

34:58.630 --> 34:59.430
and wait here.

35:00.150 --> 35:00.590
Yes.

35:04.800 --> 35:06.280
Master Ye, the heir of Marquis Changxing

35:06.280 --> 35:09.210
and the Fifth Madam Gu
are here to pay their respects.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.460
Given your status,

36:16.480 --> 36:17.400
a bow is enough.

37:30.080 --> 37:32.210
Did your mother really die of illness?

37:41.970 --> 37:43.710
Why would you say that?

37:44.810 --> 37:45.810
What do you think?

37:46.150 --> 37:46.840
Others may not know,

37:46.840 --> 37:47.800
but I do.

37:49.550 --> 37:51.160
Your mother was murdered.

37:51.880 --> 37:52.710
Who did it?

37:53.190 --> 37:54.520
I'll help you kill them.

38:03.550 --> 38:04.360
Good child.

38:05.030 --> 38:05.940
I heard

38:05.970 --> 38:08.070
you've been handling
all the funeral arrangements.

38:08.070 --> 38:09.600
Take good care of yourself.

38:09.960 --> 38:11.110
Your mother's spirit in heaven

38:11.110 --> 38:11.800
would surely be comforted

38:11.800 --> 38:12.760
to see how filial

38:13.070 --> 38:14.070
you and Rong are.

38:15.510 --> 38:16.590
Thank you, Mrs. Gu.

38:18.230 --> 38:19.830
Then we shall take our leave.

38:21.920 --> 38:23.520
-Gu Jinzhao.
-Go back first.

38:30.320 --> 38:31.030
Do you have any idea

38:31.030 --> 38:32.090
what you're doing?

38:32.150 --> 38:33.690
You, the heir of a marquisate,

38:33.690 --> 38:34.550
were kneeling before the coffin

38:34.550 --> 38:35.510
of a commoner woman

38:35.510 --> 38:37.190
without even an official title.

38:37.190 --> 38:38.410
With so many eyes watching,

38:38.410 --> 38:40.070
how improper is this conduct!

38:40.390 --> 38:41.390
I truly regret it.

38:41.550 --> 38:43.630
I should never have softened my heart
and brought you here.

38:43.630 --> 38:45.430
You're not being soft-hearted.

38:45.510 --> 38:47.710
You just wanted to use this opportunity
to remind me

38:47.710 --> 38:49.440
to give up on Gu Jinzhao.

38:50.330 --> 38:51.460
Even if that's true,

38:51.550 --> 38:52.710
I'm doing this for your own good

38:52.710 --> 38:54.040
and for the marquisate.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.710
Do you think I want to be

38:55.710 --> 38:57.110
the one to tear you apart?

38:58.400 --> 38:59.980
If I were a man,

39:00.100 --> 39:01.320
able to establish my own household

39:01.320 --> 39:02.560
and serve the marquisate,

39:02.560 --> 39:04.160
I wouldn't need to force you.

39:04.230 --> 39:06.090
You could marry whoever you want.

39:07.110 --> 39:08.320
But I am not.

39:08.960 --> 39:09.880
I can only support my husband

39:09.880 --> 39:10.880
and raise my children
in another household,

39:10.880 --> 39:13.810
watching our family's future
with growing anxiety.

39:46.880 --> 39:47.480
If I had known

39:47.480 --> 39:49.480
you would treat yourself like this,

39:49.710 --> 39:50.710
I should have let you

39:50.710 --> 39:51.550
die back then.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.760
Why did I even bother saving you?

39:55.760 --> 39:57.490
Madam Ji didn't die of illness.

39:58.440 --> 39:59.360
Obviously.

40:00.880 --> 40:02.400
I asked Zhao who did it,

40:03.070 --> 40:04.270
but she wouldn't say.

40:04.400 --> 40:06.110
It's not that she wouldn't say.

40:06.110 --> 40:07.400
She couldn't.

40:08.190 --> 40:08.960
Madam Ji

40:09.030 --> 40:10.560
was probably not murdered.

40:11.150 --> 40:12.480
She took her own life.

40:15.290 --> 40:16.410
How do you know?

40:19.670 --> 40:21.320
Didn't I tell you last time?

40:24.550 --> 40:25.550
Madam Ji

40:27.070 --> 40:28.510
suffered from liver qi stagnation

40:28.510 --> 40:31.000
and depression
that developed into illness.

40:31.000 --> 40:32.190
For someone like that,

40:32.190 --> 40:34.520
if they cannot resolve their inner knots,

40:34.630 --> 40:35.770
it more often than

40:36.320 --> 40:37.450
not ends in suicide.

40:38.960 --> 40:40.930
It's just unfortunate for Miss Gu.

40:41.280 --> 40:43.610
She lost her mother before ever marrying.

40:44.070 --> 40:45.400
It's also troublesome.

40:48.000 --> 40:49.280
I will take care of her.

40:51.030 --> 40:52.840
I know what you are thinking.

40:53.110 --> 40:54.510
You are overthinking it.

40:54.630 --> 40:56.090
You can't take care of her.

40:56.920 --> 40:58.280
Why don't even you believe me?

40:58.280 --> 41:00.140
It's not that I don't believe you.

41:00.280 --> 41:01.280
In this world,

41:01.960 --> 41:03.890
if you can't stand on your own feet,

41:03.920 --> 41:05.580
you can't take care of anyone.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.840
With your health,

41:08.880 --> 41:10.360
no matter how capable I am,

41:10.670 --> 41:11.730
I can't heal you enough

41:11.730 --> 41:13.790
to fight enemies on the battlefield.

41:14.590 --> 41:15.920
If you can't stand firm,

41:16.000 --> 41:18.130
this marquisate cannot stand either.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.720
If the marquisate falls,

41:20.000 --> 41:21.070
you will have no say

41:21.440 --> 41:22.770
over your own marriage.

41:24.510 --> 41:26.000
This is all fate.

41:27.110 --> 41:28.400
Others may believe in fate,

41:28.400 --> 41:29.320
but I don't.

41:30.190 --> 41:31.000
Back then, everyone

41:31.000 --> 41:32.110
said my heart condition was severe

41:32.110 --> 41:33.550
and I wouldn't live past ten.

41:33.550 --> 41:34.230
But you still saved me,

41:34.230 --> 41:35.190
didn't you?

41:36.710 --> 41:37.720
I don't believe

41:37.840 --> 41:40.230
that military merit
is the only way to stand firm.

41:40.230 --> 41:41.230
In this world,

41:41.590 --> 41:42.480
there must be

41:42.480 --> 41:44.340
a path other than military merit.

41:48.530 --> 41:52.380
[Harmony Brings Blessings]

41:49.670 --> 41:51.070
Upon hearing of Madam Ji's

41:51.070 --> 41:52.000
sudden passing,

41:52.550 --> 41:54.150
my mother was deeply grieved

41:54.150 --> 41:55.550
and has specially sent me

41:55.920 --> 41:57.920
to offer condolences on her behalf.

41:58.000 --> 42:00.110
The Old Madam truly values old ties.

42:01.550 --> 42:02.190
Lord Chen.

42:03.280 --> 42:04.150
My younger brother

42:04.150 --> 42:05.400
has been struck by sudden misfortune

42:05.400 --> 42:06.630
and is gravely ill and bedridden.

42:06.630 --> 42:07.230
Otherwise,

42:07.230 --> 42:08.150
he would definitely have come
to receive you in person.

42:08.150 --> 42:08.840
It's fine.

43:27.900 --> 43:31.240
[A Splendid Match]
